_paragraph\" >Turn left or right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire with perfect timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track enemies using your radar</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid collisions. Outmaneuver attackers. Stay alive as long as you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No cutscenes. No exposition.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your ship, and the end of everything.</p>", "short_description": "Pilot a lone ship across a stark, vector-style battlefield as the world steadily collapses into the sun. Combat focuses on precision: aim carefully, fire deliberately, and dodge incoming shots from autonomous enemy constructs that track and engage on sight.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607350/710fe9f19919edf7ced5fb1645b39fea7604c370/header.jpg?t=1785444593", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607350/5855bd89405f8c7879f462b1337daf4a87c3caff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785444593", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4607350/5855bd89405f8c7879f462b1337daf4a87c3caff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785444593", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU (e.g. Intel i3 / AMD equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000+<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core CPU (e.g. Intel i3 / 